WEBVTT

00:00:23.330 --> 00:00:24.660
Eripiyo.

00:00:24.660 --> 00:00:25.620
Yes?

00:00:25.620 --> 00:00:27.910
Don't freak out on me.

00:00:27.910 --> 00:00:29.250
Okay...?

00:00:29.250 --> 00:00:29.870
Cham... is going to appear in this.

00:00:29.870 --> 00:00:31.660
"City Memorial Hall"
Cham... is going to appear in this.

00:00:33.750 --> 00:00:35.620
Okayama Girls' Festa?!

00:00:35.620 --> 00:00:40.120
You mean the event that all
the girls in Okayama gather at?!

00:00:40.120 --> 00:00:43.540
It hasn't been announced officially yet, but...

00:00:43.540 --> 00:00:46.700
But this was included as one
of the fliers in our newspaper.

00:00:46.700 --> 00:00:50.750
Finally! I'll finally be able to witness
Maina go down that runway!

00:00:50.750 --> 00:00:53.620
Reo's definitely going to look great
in anything she wears!

00:00:55.120 --> 00:00:56.160
Hey, wait a sec.

00:00:57.080 --> 00:00:59.580
"(Certain members to be chosen for appearance)"

00:00:59.870 --> 00:01:02.370
Right. I knew it.
They're not picking all of them.

00:01:02.370 --> 00:01:06.660
Of course, it's going to be the top three
of Reo, Sorane, and Maki.

00:01:06.660 --> 00:01:11.700
You can go feel awkward by yourself,
surrounded by all those young girls.

00:01:11.700 --> 00:01:15.250
Come on, now. Maina might be able to go, too.

00:01:15.250 --> 00:01:16.750
What do you mean, "too"?

00:01:16.750 --> 00:01:19.370
Must be nice since you never
have to worry about Reo's popularity.

00:01:19.370 --> 00:01:22.160
I wanted to go with you, Eripiyo...

00:01:22.160 --> 00:01:24.790
You just want to go with me because I'm a girl!

00:01:24.790 --> 00:01:28.660
It'd be easier for you to go if you were
with a girl. Quit being so naïve!

00:01:28.660 --> 00:01:32.250
Don't be like that.
We've known each other for so long.

00:01:33.080 --> 00:01:35.000
I mean, it's not like...

00:01:35.000 --> 00:01:36.910
...I even have anything to wear.

00:01:38.540 --> 00:01:41.040
You used to actually wear decent clothes.

00:01:41.040 --> 00:01:44.410
I'm actually going to that
with my little sister.

00:01:44.410 --> 00:01:46.370
My little sister's friend
is going to be on the show,

00:01:46.370 --> 00:01:48.580
so she gave us tickets.

00:01:48.580 --> 00:01:51.540
Motoi just appeared out of nowhere
and clearly has a winning family situation!

00:03:23.660 --> 00:03:26.450
I thought about it really hard for two seconds,

00:03:26.450 --> 00:03:28.750
but I can't go to the Girls' Festa.

00:03:28.750 --> 00:03:30.370
"I Always Want to Love You the Most"
I don't have anything to wear.

00:03:30.370 --> 00:03:33.160
"I Always Want to Love You the Most"
Just come in your tracksuit.

00:03:33.160 --> 00:03:35.830
Oh, is that you, Kumasa?

00:03:36.580 --> 00:03:37.660
Well, well.

00:03:37.660 --> 00:03:43.160
I knew it. It's been a while.
Never thought I'd see you here.

00:03:43.160 --> 00:03:44.200
Um...

00:03:44.200 --> 00:03:47.700
Oh, they're fellow Cham fans.

00:03:47.700 --> 00:03:51.200
Ah, I see you're still chasing Reo then.

00:03:51.200 --> 00:03:54.830
I'm currently following
a group called Maple Doll.

00:03:54.830 --> 00:03:56.250
I see...

00:03:56.250 --> 00:04:00.200
I'm glad to see that we're both
living our best lives.

00:04:00.200 --> 00:04:02.200
Now, if you'll excuse me.

00:04:02.200 --> 00:04:03.620
Who was that?

00:04:03.620 --> 00:04:05.660
He was part of my old crew.

00:04:05.660 --> 00:04:08.830
Oh, with the group Reo used to be in...

00:04:08.830 --> 00:04:10.620
The group she used to be in?

00:04:11.660 --> 00:04:13.450
Yes, that was...

00:04:13.450 --> 00:04:17.080
That was back when Kumasa
was still just another rando to me...

00:04:17.080 --> 00:04:18.080
Uh, hello?

00:04:29.580 --> 00:04:33.040
I'm pretty sure she just responded to you, miss.

00:04:33.040 --> 00:04:33.950
Huh?

00:04:33.950 --> 00:04:37.540
Maina. She waved at you.

00:04:37.540 --> 00:04:40.500
This girl, wearing the salmon pink dress.

00:04:44.450 --> 00:04:46.870
Which girl are you a fan of?

00:04:46.870 --> 00:04:49.580
The center, Reo.

00:04:49.580 --> 00:04:55.330
She used to be part of an indie
idol group that made it pretty far.

00:04:55.330 --> 00:04:58.120
But that group suddenly broke up.

00:04:58.120 --> 00:05:02.080
Now, she's part of this underground idol group.

00:05:02.080 --> 00:05:07.620
But Reo's the center now.
She was always off to the side.

00:05:07.620 --> 00:05:10.580
That made me so happy.

00:05:10.580 --> 00:05:14.410
Because I've been supporting
her for three years now.

00:05:14.410 --> 00:05:16.160
Um...

00:05:16.160 --> 00:05:20.580
Do you think Maina will ever
be able to be the center?

00:05:20.580 --> 00:05:22.790
That's not happening as long as Reo's around.

00:05:33.410 --> 00:05:37.450
And that's how Maina
and I had our fateful meeting...

00:05:37.450 --> 00:05:40.620
It seems like this somehow became about you!

00:05:40.620 --> 00:05:43.450
No, this is how Maina and I first met.

00:05:45.870 --> 00:05:46.870
I...

00:05:47.910 --> 00:05:53.200
I know that I can't be anyone's number one.

00:05:53.200 --> 00:05:54.540
So...

00:05:54.540 --> 00:05:57.700
I always want to love Reo the most.

00:06:07.910 --> 00:06:09.580
Hey.

00:06:09.580 --> 00:06:11.410
They definitely don't belong here.

00:06:11.410 --> 00:06:13.830
Maybe some idols are performing or something.

00:06:13.830 --> 00:06:16.330
Oh, so they're <i>otaku</i>s here to see them?

00:06:16.330 --> 00:06:18.950
The embarrassment I'm feeling
right now is on another level!

00:06:18.950 --> 00:06:20.870
This is far worse than our usual outdoor events.

00:06:20.870 --> 00:06:22.790
Be strong, Kumasa!

00:06:22.790 --> 00:06:27.080
I tried to at least remember I'm a girl
and decided to do my hair all nice.

00:06:27.080 --> 00:06:29.660
Also, I decided to wear
a yellow T-shirt underneath

00:06:29.660 --> 00:06:31.580
so it'd bring out the red in my tracksuit more.

00:06:31.580 --> 00:06:35.910
That's a Cham shirt! You never wear that,
so why are you wearing it here?!

00:06:35.910 --> 00:06:39.330
I actually didn't want to wear it
since it's not Maina's salmon pink,

00:06:39.330 --> 00:06:41.450
but these are the only clothes I have!

00:06:41.450 --> 00:06:42.660
Tch. Tch. Tch.

00:06:44.950 --> 00:06:46.870
"Trendy girls"
Gloom...

00:06:48.370 --> 00:06:53.700
Just so you know, I'm actually wearing
luxury brands from head to toe.

00:06:53.700 --> 00:06:54.330
Uh...

00:06:54.330 --> 00:06:55.910
Don't get creeped out by that!

00:06:58.040 --> 00:06:59.290
So cute!

00:07:01.160 --> 00:07:03.330
They're even cuter in person
than in the magazines!

00:07:05.580 --> 00:07:07.000
They're so lucky...

00:07:07.620 --> 00:07:10.540
Cham's never even really been in a magazine.

00:07:10.540 --> 00:07:12.660
They're even cuter in person than on TV!

00:07:12.660 --> 00:07:15.870
They've never been on anything
other than local TV.

00:07:15.870 --> 00:07:20.000
However, if we actually let this get us down,
we'd be failures as <i>wota</i>s!

00:07:20.000 --> 00:07:24.580
<i>Wota</i>s need to show solidarity
even if their faves aren't at the event!

00:07:24.580 --> 00:07:29.200
So cute! Way cuter than they are in magazines!

00:07:29.200 --> 00:07:31.160
--Uh, they're sorta creepy...
--There are actually fans like that?

00:07:31.160 --> 00:07:32.660
"Trendy girls"
Gloom...

00:07:32.660 --> 00:07:34.370
This is a living hell...

00:07:34.370 --> 00:07:37.330
And now, let's bring out our special guests!

00:07:38.830 --> 00:07:43.370
"Reo Igarashi"

00:07:52.040 --> 00:07:55.870
"Reo Igarashi"

00:07:56.000 --> 00:07:57.000
Who is that?

00:07:57.540 --> 00:07:58.620
Who is that?

00:07:58.620 --> 00:08:00.330
I guess one of the special guests?

00:08:00.330 --> 00:08:01.750
I mean, she's cute, but...

00:08:01.750 --> 00:08:03.950
This painfully awkward atmosphere...

00:08:06.000 --> 00:08:10.200
Kumasa, call out Reo's name.

00:08:10.200 --> 00:08:13.950
Sorry... This situation's already
too much for me to bear.

00:08:17.160 --> 00:08:18.410
Kumasa!

00:08:21.500 --> 00:08:23.620
Notice us, Reo!

00:08:23.620 --> 00:08:24.750
Find him!

00:08:45.910 --> 00:08:47.080
A direct response!

00:08:47.080 --> 00:08:49.910
Reo!

00:08:51.870 --> 00:08:55.330
Thank goodness I love Reo so much!

00:08:55.330 --> 00:08:59.910
Good for you! Though I'm basically chopped liver
right now since I've never gotten a direct response!

00:09:01.000 --> 00:09:04.580
But it's not like I'm surprised that Reo
was chosen for this event.

00:09:04.580 --> 00:09:05.910
The battle's just begun!

00:09:06.120 --> 00:09:09.410
"Sorane Matsuyama"

00:09:09.580 --> 00:09:11.500
I totally knew Sorane would be here, too.

00:09:11.500 --> 00:09:12.910
Sorane!

00:09:12.910 --> 00:09:14.830
Oh, I hear Motoi.

00:09:14.830 --> 00:09:16.910
Now if the next one to appear is Maki,

00:09:16.910 --> 00:09:19.660
there's a huge possibility
that it's just the top three.

00:09:19.660 --> 00:09:22.160
That's how it's always been.

00:09:22.160 --> 00:09:23.830
They make it sound like they're selected,

00:09:23.830 --> 00:09:27.330
but it's clear that their agency's
only pushing the top three.

00:09:27.330 --> 00:09:29.450
Please show up, Maina!

00:09:32.290 --> 00:09:35.750
"Maki Hakata"

00:09:38.870 --> 00:09:40.200
Maki!

00:09:40.200 --> 00:09:41.580
Maki, you're so cute!

00:09:42.790 --> 00:09:44.000
And there's...

00:09:44.910 --> 00:09:46.160
...Maki...

00:09:47.830 --> 00:09:49.000
Eripiyo...

00:09:49.000 --> 00:09:52.120
Don't worry about it. I know.
I'm used to it by now.

00:09:52.120 --> 00:09:54.120
Maki!

00:09:54.120 --> 00:09:56.790
It's definitely not her fault.

00:09:56.790 --> 00:09:59.160
It's the agency's fault for clearly
treating them differently!

00:10:01.160 --> 00:10:04.250
No matter how hard I tried to get a ticket,

00:10:04.250 --> 00:10:08.080
there were still plenty of events
Maina didn't even appear at.

00:10:08.080 --> 00:10:10.620
But I never regretted it even once.

00:10:10.620 --> 00:10:14.200
I'd regret it even more if Maina showed up
to an event I decided not to go to.

00:10:18.330 --> 00:10:21.700
At least we got to see how cute Reo is.

00:10:21.700 --> 00:10:23.500
Eripiyo!

00:10:23.500 --> 00:10:24.660
It's not...

00:10:24.660 --> 00:10:26.790
It's not over yet!

00:10:26.790 --> 00:10:27.410
Huh?

00:10:27.410 --> 00:10:28.660
Look!

00:10:30.040 --> 00:10:31.750
"Maina Ichii"

00:10:51.410 --> 00:10:52.870
M-Maina!

00:11:09.700 --> 00:11:11.540
Wait... Was Maina crying?

00:11:13.750 --> 00:11:16.450
Because she didn't like the fact
that I showed up here, too?

00:11:18.200 --> 00:11:23.200
Eripiyo was here.
She was even wearing our T-shirt...

00:11:26.950 --> 00:11:28.120
Maina?

00:11:28.120 --> 00:11:31.080
What's wrong, Maina? Are you nervous?

00:11:33.580 --> 00:11:37.540
I didn't think anyone would
be out there waiting for me.

00:11:39.660 --> 00:11:41.250
That's not true!

00:11:41.250 --> 00:11:44.120
I'm only here because
they didn't have anyone else.

00:11:44.120 --> 00:11:46.200
That's not true.

00:11:46.200 --> 00:11:49.660
You were still chosen to be here, Maina.

00:11:50.950 --> 00:11:53.410
She chose me...

00:11:55.160 --> 00:11:57.750
Thank you, Eripiyo...

00:12:00.120 --> 00:12:01.000
So cute!

00:12:01.000 --> 00:12:02.200
I'm buying the magazine!

00:12:02.200 --> 00:12:03.580
So friggin' cute!

00:12:03.580 --> 00:12:05.870
--I'll buy three copies!
--After showing love for their faves,

00:12:05.870 --> 00:12:10.120
the <i>otaku</i>s regained their energy
and enjoyed the rest of the festa.

00:12:16.000 --> 00:12:17.410
"I really didn't think that I was
going to be in the show today,

00:12:17.410 --> 00:12:20.910
"I really didn't think that I was
going to be in the show today,
"ChamJam Official Blog"
"Thanks for everything, GF! / Maina"

00:12:20.910 --> 00:12:22.950
so I was really surprised!

00:12:22.950 --> 00:12:27.120
Apparently, they had some outfits
that were smaller than usual,

00:12:27.120 --> 00:12:29.250
so they asked me to be on it

00:12:29.250 --> 00:12:32.080
so they could showcase those in the show."

00:12:32.080 --> 00:12:36.330
She doesn't have to say that... She's so humble.

00:12:36.330 --> 00:12:38.200
But that's what's so great about her!

00:12:38.200 --> 00:12:41.200
"I was so happy"

00:12:43.370 --> 00:12:44.660
I was...

00:12:46.120 --> 00:12:48.330
...really happy, too...

00:12:56.290 --> 00:13:00.580
I was really happy, too, Maina!

00:13:01.700 --> 00:13:04.200
Do you realize how late it is, Eri?!

00:13:04.200 --> 00:13:07.620
"I'll never forget the view from the runway.
I hope I can be in the show again next year"
I love you, Maina!

00:13:12.290 --> 00:13:14.370
Eripiyo, Motoi.

00:13:14.370 --> 00:13:15.200
"Okayama Station Shopping District"
Yes?

00:13:15.200 --> 00:13:17.000
Now, stay calm...

00:13:17.000 --> 00:13:18.250
Sure?

00:13:18.250 --> 00:13:21.500
Reo replied to my fan letter!

00:13:21.500 --> 00:13:22.580
Really?

00:13:22.580 --> 00:13:23.660
Huh...

00:13:23.660 --> 00:13:26.370
Wait, isn't that pretty amazing?

00:13:26.370 --> 00:13:30.330
I try not to react to other
people's fan service stuff.

00:13:30.330 --> 00:13:33.330
It's okay. I know I'm not wrong.

00:13:33.330 --> 00:13:36.000
No matter how much Maina has no interest in me,

00:13:36.000 --> 00:13:38.040
I still love Maina.

00:13:38.040 --> 00:13:39.410
Eripiyo...

00:13:39.410 --> 00:13:43.160
Oh, you mustn't pity her, Motoi.

00:13:43.160 --> 00:13:46.540
This is how Eripiyo is keeping herself sane.

00:13:46.540 --> 00:13:49.410
I'm breaking all of your penlights
at the next event, Kumasa.

00:13:49.410 --> 00:13:53.040
I've never received a reply from Sorane...

00:13:53.040 --> 00:13:55.000
When did you send the letter?

00:13:55.000 --> 00:13:59.330
Maybe she still hasn't gotten
it from the agency.

00:13:59.330 --> 00:14:03.450
I mean, I've never sent Maina a letter.

00:14:03.450 --> 00:14:04.410
Wait, you're kidding!

00:14:04.410 --> 00:14:08.250
What? I mean... it's not like
I'm going to get a reply,

00:14:08.250 --> 00:14:10.160
and I get to interact with her in person.

00:14:10.160 --> 00:14:12.950
You say that, but you haven't technically
interacted with her at all.

00:14:12.950 --> 00:14:14.620
I'll break your teeth, too.

00:14:16.160 --> 00:14:18.450
Have I ever fallen for one of my fans?

00:14:18.450 --> 00:14:19.040
Yeah...

00:14:19.040 --> 00:14:20.700
What? Of course not.

00:14:20.700 --> 00:14:23.160
Of... course.

00:14:23.160 --> 00:14:26.830
Oh, I didn't mean it like that.

00:14:26.830 --> 00:14:28.830
How do I put this?

00:14:28.830 --> 00:14:32.000
That'd be like betraying the fans,

00:14:32.000 --> 00:14:33.830
right?

00:14:33.830 --> 00:14:35.910
I see...

00:14:35.910 --> 00:14:40.700
But I mean... The only one who's my fan
and no one else's is Eripiyo...

00:14:42.250 --> 00:14:44.660
N-Nice to meet you...

00:14:44.660 --> 00:14:48.580
Hey, I felt bad because no one was in your line.

00:14:48.580 --> 00:14:50.910
I'm actually a Maki stan.

00:14:50.910 --> 00:14:53.160
You don't have to tell me that!

00:14:53.160 --> 00:14:55.450
I didn't have the courage
to get in Sorane's line...

00:14:55.450 --> 00:14:57.120
Seriously?!

00:14:57.120 --> 00:14:59.120
Reo! I went to see you at Girls' Festa!

00:14:59.120 --> 00:15:02.290
--Thanks for remembering me, Sorane!
--Wow, thank you! I'm so happy!

00:15:02.290 --> 00:15:05.250
--Of course. Oh, you cut your hair.
--Wow, thank you! I'm so happy!

00:15:06.500 --> 00:15:11.620
Oh, that's the Reo stan
that's always with Eripiyo...

00:15:12.870 --> 00:15:16.290
Thank you! I guess this is technically
our first official meeting.

00:15:16.290 --> 00:15:20.000
I-Is he switching his favorite to me?

00:15:20.000 --> 00:15:25.370
I hope this doesn't make his
and Eripiyo's relationship awkward...

00:15:25.370 --> 00:15:27.120
Oh...

00:15:27.120 --> 00:15:29.500
Well, my friend is your stan,

00:15:29.500 --> 00:15:32.620
but she wasn't able to come today
because she got the flu.

00:15:32.620 --> 00:15:33.790
Huh?

00:15:33.790 --> 00:15:36.330
I hope you'll continue to be kind to her.

00:15:36.330 --> 00:15:42.580
Of course! Absolutely! I hope you
continue to support Reo, too!

00:15:42.580 --> 00:15:43.660
What a goddess!

00:15:47.160 --> 00:15:48.870
What do you think, A-ya?

00:15:48.870 --> 00:15:53.080
Huh? Hm... I never really thought about it.

00:15:53.080 --> 00:15:55.200
I guess a kid like you wouldn't understand.

00:15:55.200 --> 00:15:56.580
I am not a kid!

00:15:56.580 --> 00:15:59.660
Oh, whoops. Gotta go.

00:15:59.660 --> 00:16:00.500
Part-time job?

00:16:00.500 --> 00:16:04.660
Yup. Yuka just messaged me saying she's
almost here, so I'll leave the rest to you.

00:16:04.660 --> 00:16:05.830
You guys are so close.

00:16:05.830 --> 00:16:07.330
Nah, not at all.

00:16:07.330 --> 00:16:09.450
I guess we'll see you tomorrow.

00:16:09.450 --> 00:16:10.700
Have fun at work!

00:16:10.700 --> 00:16:12.370
Thanks.

00:16:12.370 --> 00:16:14.040
You guys have fun, too!

00:16:15.410 --> 00:16:17.660
Oh, A-ya.

00:16:17.660 --> 00:16:19.700
She only packed Yuka's color.

00:16:19.700 --> 00:16:21.040
You're right.

00:16:27.580 --> 00:16:29.370
I definitely saw one!

00:16:29.370 --> 00:16:32.620
Oh, no... It's behind the fridge!

00:16:35.330 --> 00:16:37.330
Morning.

00:16:37.330 --> 00:16:40.620
Morn... Huh? Oh, I thought you were Yuka.

00:16:40.620 --> 00:16:42.830
I was in the neighborhood, so I stopped by.

00:16:42.830 --> 00:16:47.250
Actually, Yuka told me she was going to be
late because she saw a cockroach at her house.

00:16:47.250 --> 00:16:49.620
--Huh?
--Why did you get a message?

00:16:49.620 --> 00:16:52.290
Who knows? She probably sent it by mistake.

00:16:52.290 --> 00:16:55.040
I was messaging her last night.

00:16:55.040 --> 00:16:57.080
She's basically fired.

00:16:57.080 --> 00:16:58.790
So, uh...

00:16:58.790 --> 00:17:00.450
--Oh, fan letters?
--Yeah.

00:17:00.450 --> 00:17:04.450
I should take some home with me.
I don't want my replies to pile up.

00:17:04.450 --> 00:17:08.540
Must be nice. I've never gotten a fan letter.

00:17:08.540 --> 00:17:10.330
--What?
--Really?

00:17:10.330 --> 00:17:11.660
Um, yeah...

00:17:11.660 --> 00:17:13.120
Not even from Eripiyo?!

00:17:13.120 --> 00:17:14.700
Yeah...

00:17:14.700 --> 00:17:17.870
I would love to write a reply...

00:17:17.870 --> 00:17:22.500
I'm always so nervous in front of her,
but if I were to write to her,

00:17:22.500 --> 00:17:25.080
I'm sure I could get my true feelings out.

00:17:25.080 --> 00:17:26.040
"I love you, Eripiyo"

00:17:26.540 --> 00:17:30.790
Why not ask her to write you a letter
when she comes to shake your hand?

00:17:30.790 --> 00:17:34.500
Huh? But I don't know if I can ask her myself.

00:17:34.500 --> 00:17:35.870
In that case,

00:17:35.870 --> 00:17:40.620
at our next concert, I'll ask you what you want
most right now when I'm emceeing,

00:17:40.620 --> 00:17:43.250
then you could totally say fan letters.

00:17:43.250 --> 00:17:44.750
We can do that?!

00:17:44.750 --> 00:17:46.540
I don't see why not. Right, Reo?

00:17:46.540 --> 00:17:47.790
Totally.

00:17:52.620 --> 00:17:53.620
A stink--

00:17:54.620 --> 00:17:56.950
S-S-Stinkbu--

00:17:56.950 --> 00:18:02.160
Crap, crap, crap! Why is it inside?!
That's basically breaking and entering!

00:18:03.950 --> 00:18:08.370
Yume, you were totally in the audience
at Girls' Festa, weren't you?

00:18:08.370 --> 00:18:10.370
Huh?

00:18:10.370 --> 00:18:15.080
Aw... I was trying to make sure
you didn't find me.

00:18:15.080 --> 00:18:16.160
Of course I'd find you.

00:18:18.370 --> 00:18:21.080
I always know where you are.

00:18:22.330 --> 00:18:23.500
Liar.

00:18:23.500 --> 00:18:25.870
I've never lied to you.

00:18:28.370 --> 00:18:30.160
Let's both be in the show next year.

00:18:33.120 --> 00:18:34.120
Oh.

00:18:36.500 --> 00:18:37.790
It's from Yuka.

00:18:37.790 --> 00:18:39.040
Oh, jeez.

00:18:39.040 --> 00:18:43.250
"The cockroach got away and now there's
a stink bug. I can't. I'm going to bed."

00:18:43.250 --> 00:18:45.200
Apparently.

00:18:45.200 --> 00:18:47.410
Why did she send you that?

00:18:47.410 --> 00:18:48.580
I have no idea...

00:18:50.080 --> 00:18:51.870
"Regularly Scheduled Performance Day"

00:18:52.250 --> 00:18:55.120
Let's see... It's already July,

00:18:55.120 --> 00:18:59.370
but last month was June.
And speaking of June, there's Father's Day.

00:18:59.370 --> 00:19:06.290
If you guys were dads, or not, is there
anything special you'd like to receive?

00:19:06.290 --> 00:19:07.540
Wait, what?

00:19:07.540 --> 00:19:08.660
This is so forced.

00:19:08.660 --> 00:19:10.080
So forced...

00:19:10.080 --> 00:19:11.830
I'd want bug spray!

00:19:11.830 --> 00:19:13.040
That's nice. What about you, Maina?

00:19:13.040 --> 00:19:15.000
Uh, um...

00:19:15.000 --> 00:19:18.580
Um... I'd like some fan le...

00:19:18.580 --> 00:19:21.660
Wait. If I actually say letters...

00:19:21.660 --> 00:19:25.450
"To Maina"
I wrote you a letter, but it might take
two years for you to finish reading it!

00:19:25.450 --> 00:19:28.160
You'll accept this, right, Maina?

00:19:28.160 --> 00:19:31.580
Eripiyo will probably go overboard...

00:19:31.580 --> 00:19:35.500
I need to make sure I don't
cause Eripiyo any trouble...

00:19:40.120 --> 00:19:42.370
She's really thinking about this.

00:19:42.370 --> 00:19:43.410
Maina?

00:19:47.160 --> 00:19:48.160
Hai...

00:19:49.160 --> 00:19:50.540
Haiku strips...

00:19:52.000 --> 00:19:53.250
Haiku strips?

00:19:53.250 --> 00:19:54.250
Yeah...

00:19:54.250 --> 00:19:56.410
"I hope Maina can keep smiling every day"
--Then it'd just be one strip of paper.

00:19:56.410 --> 00:19:58.200
--Um...
--Then it'd just be one strip of paper.

00:19:58.200 --> 00:20:01.410
I mean, I guess it is almost Tanabata.
Yeah. I guess everyone would want those!

00:20:01.410 --> 00:20:02.830
--So she'll get wishes from the fans...

00:20:02.830 --> 00:20:04.370
--Um, what about you, Reo?
--So she'll get wishes from the fans...

00:20:04.370 --> 00:20:05.910
--Well, for me...
--Haiku... paper?

00:20:05.910 --> 00:20:06.750
--I definitely want bug spray!
--Well, for me...
--Haiku... paper?

00:20:06.750 --> 00:20:09.330
--I definitely want bug spray!
--What is your deal with...
--Please do not give her a bamboo plant

00:20:09.330 --> 00:20:11.330
filled with them or write stuff
on 10,000 yen notes, please...

00:20:12.330 --> 00:20:13.580
"The next week"

00:20:13.580 --> 00:20:15.200
"To Maina"

00:20:15.200 --> 00:20:19.250
My first ever fan letter, or rather,
fan letter strip!

00:20:19.250 --> 00:20:21.290
Did you write that on a fishcake board?

00:20:21.290 --> 00:20:23.620
Hey, don't joke like that.
That's actually funny.

00:20:23.620 --> 00:20:24.700
I wasn't joking.

00:20:25.450 --> 00:20:27.120
I wrote 100 strips!

00:20:27.120 --> 00:20:29.700
That's basically a fan letter!

00:20:29.700 --> 00:20:31.830
There are wishes written in there, too!

00:20:33.330 --> 00:20:36.410
--I hope Maina stays healthy every day.
--I hope Maina is happy forever.

00:20:36.410 --> 00:20:39.750
--I hope Maina will be the center someday.
--I hope I can use the same shampoo
as Maina to smell like her.

00:20:39.750 --> 00:20:42.160
--I hope Maina's able to go to Budokan.
--I hope I can use the same shampoo
as Maina to smell like her.

00:20:42.160 --> 00:20:46.290
--I want to take a bath with Maina.
--I want to peek into Maina's room.

00:20:46.290 --> 00:20:51.540
Because they're used to write wishes on,
your dirty wishes got mixed in.

00:20:51.540 --> 00:20:57.160
This concludes today's event.
Please start heading towards the exit.

00:20:57.160 --> 00:21:00.040
Excuse me, staff person. Here.

00:21:00.040 --> 00:21:02.120
Please give this to Maina!

00:21:05.120 --> 00:21:07.000
Great job today.

00:21:07.000 --> 00:21:08.660
You, too.

00:21:08.660 --> 00:21:10.040
What's that?

00:21:10.040 --> 00:21:13.290
Bug spray. Apparently, it's a gift for Yuka.

00:21:13.290 --> 00:21:16.500
Ah. Well, she did mention
she wanted some the other day.

00:21:16.500 --> 00:21:19.450
Apparently, it's pretty powerful.
Even works on rodents.

00:21:19.450 --> 00:21:20.790
Huh...

00:21:20.790 --> 00:21:21.750
And what do you have there?

00:21:21.750 --> 00:21:23.040
"To Maina"
And what do you have there?

00:21:23.040 --> 00:21:26.080
"To Maina"
Eripiyo gave this to me to give to Maina, but...

00:21:26.410 --> 00:21:28.290
I haven't confirmed what's inside yet.

00:21:28.290 --> 00:21:30.370
If it's from Eripiyo, I'm sure it's fine.

00:21:30.370 --> 00:21:33.950
Actually, that's exactly why I'm worried.

00:21:33.950 --> 00:21:35.620
--Well...
--Yeah.

00:21:36.540 --> 00:21:38.370
I'm just going to check...

00:21:38.370 --> 00:21:40.540
...what's inside...

00:21:47.750 --> 00:21:48.830
Eek! A mouse!

00:21:48.830 --> 00:21:49.870
What?!

00:22:02.790 --> 00:22:07.410
I can't wait to read Eripiyo's letters.

00:22:07.410 --> 00:22:10.620
I can't wait to read Maina's replies.

00:22:16.910 --> 00:22:17.830
"I hope I can use the same shampoo
as Maina to smell like her"

00:22:30.580 --> 00:22:34.950
"I hope Maina's able to go to Budokan"

00:24:05.660 --> 00:24:09.120
"Next episode preview"
Sorane! I want to make you happy in this life.

00:24:09.120 --> 00:24:12.500
I want you to make us delicious meals
at home and wait for me!

00:24:12.500 --> 00:24:16.410
Eripiyo and Kumasa are going to make fun
of me for actually falling for you,

00:24:16.410 --> 00:24:18.120
--but even then, I love you, Sorane!

00:24:18.120 --> 00:24:18.540
--Thank you very much!
--but even then, I love you, Sorane!

00:24:18.540 --> 00:24:19.950
"Do You Like Me?"
--Thank you very much!
--but even then, I love you, Sorane!
